# Installation Issues Encountered

## Issue 1 — Broken dpkg State

### Symptoms

```
Error: Sub-process /usr/bin/dpkg returned an error code (1)
```

### Root Cause

Interrupted package configuration during Ubuntu setup.

### Resolution Commands

```bash
sudo dpkg --configure -a
sudo apt --fix-broken install -y
```

---

## Issue 2 — initramfs / kdump-tools Failure

### Symptoms

```
update-initramfs is disabled since running on read-only media
```

### Root Cause

Kernel post-install hook failure caused by kdump-tools during initramfs generation.

### Resolution

- Removed broken kdump-tools integration
- Reconfigured package system
- Reinstalled clean environment

---

## Issue 3 — Partial Wazuh Installation

### Symptoms

```
ERROR: Wazuh indexer already installed.
```

### Root Cause

Previous failed installation left partial indexer artifacts.

### Resolution

Performed:

- service cleanup
- package removal
- reinstall from clean state

